# Deliberately NO Git LFS in this repository.
#
# The upstream SONIC tree ships runner/.gitattributes routing *.a, *.so*, *.onnx,
# *.pkl and *.csv through LFS. That file is removed here on purpose. This bundle
# exists to be copied onto a machine and run, and an LFS clone on a host without
# git-lfs installed silently yields pointer files instead of libunitree_sdk2.a,
# libddsc.so and the two policies -- which surfaces much later as a link error or
# an ONNX parse failure that says nothing about LFS.
#
# Everything is a plain git object. `git clone` is enough. The two 55 MB ONNX
# files draw a GitHub size warning; that is the intended trade.
* -filter -diff -merge
